~ start
Marley Mildred: Hey Cap'n, yesterday was eventful no?
You: I guess you could say that.
Marley Mildred: Oh lighten up. Look I'm sorry I was wrong about the whole Bob thing. But this time I'm really sure it's him.
- What do you have against Bob?
	Marley Mildred: Too whiny for how strong he is. If I were that ripped I'd be throwing guys around left and right. But he's too busy moping about his family and his home. "Waah I miss my wife and kids, waaaaahhh. Boo hoo OH BOO HOO"
- Why do you lie so much?
	Marley Mildred: Look Captain. We're pirates. We've given up on trying to be good people. So why not at least have fun?
=> END